  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for gstreamer-plugins-bad",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for gstreamer-plugins-bad fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-52718: byte count instead of a bit count in gst_av1_parser_parse_tile_list_obu() can cause parser\n  desynchronization and an application crash (bsc#1268394).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
